msgid "Do your first steps with Kdenlive video editor, using oldfilm effect"
msgstr ""

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, video editor, help, learn, easy, effects, filter, video "
"effects, stylize, oldfilm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:21
msgid "Old Film"
msgstr "Filme vello"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:23
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Moves the video up and down and adds random brightness changes, making it "
#| "look like old film footage."
msgid ""
"This effect/filter moves the video up and down and adds random brightness "
"changes, making it look like old film footage. See also :ref:`effects-dust` "
"and :ref:`effects-scratchlines` effects."
msgstr ""
"Move o vídeo arriba e abaixo e engade cambios de brillo aleatorios, para que "
"parece unha gravación vella de filme."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:25
msgid "The effect has keyframes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:33
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Old Film"
msgid "Old Film effect"
msgstr "Filme vello"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:35
msgid "**Y-Delta** - Maximum delta value of up/down move (jitter)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:37
msgid ""
"**% of picture have delta** - Set the %age of frames that have a Y-Delta "
"(jitter)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Brightness up** - Sets the value by which the image will be made lighter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:41
msgid ""
"**Brightness down** - Sets the value by which the image will be made darker"
msgstr ""

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:43
msgid ""
"**Brightness every** - Set the %age of frames that will have the brightness "
"changed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Unevendevelop up** - Sets the value by which the image will be made lighter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Unevendevelop down** - Sets the value by which the image will be made "
"darker"
msgstr ""

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Unevendevelop Duration** - Sets the time in frames of an up/down cycle for "
"uneven development"
msgstr ""

